        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana DC90 Universal Heavy Duty Door Closer</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFor doors weighing up to 330 pounds, Deltana's Heavy Duty Door closer is for universal applications. It meets handicap ADA requirements and is UL rated. An ANSI grade 1 door closer, it comes packaged with parallel bracket, sex bolts, and a cast aluminum body. The dual valve means that it has adjustable closing and latching speeds.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"100\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\"></a>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Deltana DC90 Heavy Duty Door Closer:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Adjustable closing speed.</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable latching speed.</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable backcheck.</li>\r\n<li>UL 10C Fire Rated. R27405 UL LISTED 47V5</li>\r\n<li>ANSI A 156.4 Grade 1 Certified.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\">ADA Compliant</a>: meets ANSI A 117.1 requirements.</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with parallel bracket, sex bolts, and a cast aluminum body with a forged steel arm.</li>\r\n<li>Rack and pinion with needle bearings.</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>\r\nSpecifications and Features: </b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Maximum Door Weight: 330 lbs.</li>\r\n<li>Closer Body Height: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Closer Body Length: 11-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection from Door: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Horizontal Mounting Holes: 11-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Vertical Mounting Holes: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Spring Size: 1-6</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DC9000.pdf?v=1691095328\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana DC90 Specifications Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><b><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DC90-install.pdf?v=1691095324\" target=\"new\">Deltana DC90 Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
